# 统一换行符，避免 Windows 提交后 Linux 构建出现 diff 噪声
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保留 CRLF，否则部分环境下 cmd/powershell 解析异常
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# PowerShell 脚本：仓库内统一 LF，构建脚本自身已带 UTF-8 BOM
*.ps1 text eol=lf

# 二进制依赖不做换行转换
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary

# 这些文件按二进制处理，避免 Git 尝试合并
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
